@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
# Seeded rooms (migrations/*_seed_rooms.sql)
@blue = 0199a3f0-0000-7000-8000-000000000001
@green = 0199a3f0-0000-7000-8000-000000000002
@user = 0199a3f0-0000-7000-8000-000000000007

### Paged list
GET {{base}}/rooms?page=1&size=2

### Second page
GET {{base}}/rooms?page=2&size=2

### Filter + LIKE escaping (underscore is literal)
GET {{base}}/rooms?name=_

### Page size validation -> 422
GET {{base}}/rooms?size=500

### Unique constraint (case-insensitive name) -> 409
POST {{base}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "blue ROOM", "capacity": 3}

### Create booking (stored in PostgreSQL)
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId": "{{green}}", "userId": "{{user}}", "startTime": "2026-10-05T09:00:00Z", "endTime": "2026-10-05T10:00:00Z"}

### Bookings of a room, paged
GET {{base}}/rooms/{{green}}/bookings?size=5

### Bookings filtered
GET {{base}}/bookings?userId={{user}}&status=ACTIVE&page=1&size=10
